README - PenteTest.c

This test code provides a shell for checking out your Pente solution.

It allows you to play against your solution.   Replace the file Pente.c 
with your solution.  If you want to test multiple versions of your code against
each other, you can also replace the file PenteHuman with your solution.

The test code logs the moves to a file PenteDetail.out.

NOTE:  There is no guarantee that the evaluation code will be the same as 
this test code.  Your solution must satisfy all of the problem requirements 
even if this test code does not exercise those requirements.

